{
  "_comment": [
    "Frozen tool registry. Code reads this; docs/tool-call/tool-inventories.md describes it.",
    "Gate 34 (domain must match the gold tool's domain) and the held-out carve both read it.",
    "NEVER rename or renumber an entry once bytes are published - deprecate instead.",
    "",
    "implemented: the tool EXISTS AND RUNS in olmo_core.tools, so the served model can actually",
    "invoke it. Its schema is read from the code at validation time, never transcribed here, or",
    "the dataset would drift from the runtime silently. Implemented tools are never held out:",
    "holding out a tool the product ships trades real capability for a measurement. calculator",
    "and symbolic_math also EXECUTE, so rows targeting them are verifiable by computed result",
    "rather than only by call shape.",
    "",
    "Everything else is AUTHORED: it exists only as a schema, to teach the model to read a tool",
    "description it has never seen. That is the actual skill - a model trained on three tools",
    "memorises three tools. Authored tools cannot be execution-verified.",
    "",
    "FLAT NAMES ONLY. The runtime parser requires ast.Name, so a dotted name raises at inference.",
    "Reformatting upstream data must flatten dots (see flatten_tool_name).",
    "",
    "held_out: appears ONLY in heldout rows, never in train.",
    "sibling_of: the trained tool this one is held out against. Holding out an orphan measures",
    "nothing; holding out the sibling of a trained tool measures schema generalization."
  ],
  "version": 2,
  "domains": {
    "general": {
      "substitute_carve_axis": null,
      "note": "Inventory is inherited from upstream too; hold out ~12% of the observed pool by name."
    },
    "arithmetic": {
      "substitute_carve_axis": "operand magnitude band (train <=4 digit, heldout 5-7 digit) and operator depth",
      "note": "calculator and symbolic_math are implemented and shipped, so neither is held out and 'heldout measures schema generalization' is FALSE for their cells. Both EXECUTE, so their rows carry a computed expected_result and are verified by value."
    },
    "web-search": {
      "substitute_carve_axis": "held-out entity bank and held-out parameter combinations",
      "note": "web_search is implemented and shipped, so it stays in train. It does not execute deterministically, so verification stops at call shape."
    },
    "pedagogy": {
      "substitute_carve_axis": null,
      "note": null
    }
  },
  "tools": [
    {"name": "weather_forecast_weather_api", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind", "_note": "flattened from Dolci's dotted 'weather.forecast_weather_api'"},
    {"name": "create_calendar_event", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "create_github_issue", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "translate_text", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "get_directions", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "currency_convert", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "send_email", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "create_reminder", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "book_flight", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "query_sql", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "set_thermostat", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind", "held_out": true, "sibling_of": "create_reminder"},
    {"name": "place_order", "domain": "general", "exec": "bind", "held_out": true, "sibling_of": "book_flight"},

    {"name": "calculator", "domain": "arithmetic", "exec": "value", "implemented": true, "cannot_hold_out": true},
    {"name": "symbolic_math", "domain": "arithmetic", "exec": "value", "implemented": true, "cannot_hold_out": true},
    {"name": "wolfram_alpha_query", "domain": "arithmetic", "exec": "bind"},
    {"name": "evaluate_wolfram_language", "domain": "arithmetic", "exec": "bind"},
